#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility/nikon_d90_stairstepping_fix.rst:43
msgid ""
"This effect/filter removes stairstepping artifacts from Nikon D90's 720p "
"videos by interpolation."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt/filter odstraňuje artefakty schodovitosti z 720p videí Nikon D90 "
"pomocou interpolácie."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility/nikon_d90_stairstepping_fix.rst:45
msgid ""
"Sharp lines in videos from the Nikon D90 show steps each 8th or 9th line, "
"assumedly due to poor downsampling. These can be smoothed out with this "
"filter if they become too annoying."
msgstr ""
"Ostré línie vo videách z Nikon D90 vykazujú schody každý 8. alebo 9. riadok, "
"pravdepodobne kvôli zlému prevzorkovaniu. Tieto možno vyhladiť týmto "
"filtrom, ak sa stanú príliš rušivými."

